#: data/battle.json
msgid "Defensive"
msgstr "Odbrambeni"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Uravnotežen"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Offensive"
msgstr "Napadački"

#: data/battle.json
msgid "Hold the Line"
msgstr "Drži liniju"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Beyond the Holy City runs the Smorodina, the river of fire between the living world and Nav, and every horde that comes is fed from across it. The Kalinov Bridge is the old way over it: built whole and sealed with the Ritual Arch, it lets the volkhvs close the crossing for good. The hordes know this, and will throw everything at the city on the night the arch is bound."
msgstr "Iza Svetog grada teče Smorodina, ognjena reka između sveta živih i Navi, i svaka horda koja dolazi hrani se s one strane. Kalinov most je stari put preko nje: kad se sagradi ceo i zapečati Obrednim lukom, volhvi mogu zauvek zatvoriti prelaz. Horde to znaju i u noći kad se luk veže baciće sve na grad."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Foundation Stones"
msgstr "Kamen temeljac"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Bring back a relic of the old builders from an ancient site: their mark, set in the first stone, lets the foundation lie on the burning bank."
msgstr "Donesi relikviju starih graditelja sa drevnog mesta: njihov znak, uklesan u prvi kamen, omogućava da temelj legne na ognjenu obalu."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Smorodina can't be bridged on common stone. The old builders left their first stones among the ruins they abandoned, and only stones that remember the old rites will rest on the fire's bank."
msgstr "Smorodina se ne može premostiti običnim kamenom. Stari graditelji ostavili su svoje prvo kamenje u ruševinama koje su napustili, i samo kamen koji pamti stare obrede može ležati na obali vatre."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Oak Piers"
msgstr "Hrastovi stubovi"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear a monster lair: the volkhvs won't raise an axe in the grove while the beasts are there."
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu čudovišta: volhvi neće dići sekiru u gaju dok su zveri tamo."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The piers are cut from the sacred oaks of the grove, but beasts of the North have made their lairs among the roots and nobody can fell a tree while they howl."
msgstr "Stubovi se seku od svetih hrastova iz gaja, ali su zveri Severa napravile jazbine među korenjem i niko ne može oboriti drvo dok one zavijaju."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Iron Span"
msgstr "Gvozdeni raspon"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The forge is lit from the Holy City's own flame: weather a wave without the city losing Sanctity, or the flame gutters and the iron cracks."
msgstr "Kovačnica se pali od plamena samog Svetog grada: preživi talas a da grad ne izgubi svetost, inače plamen jenjava i gvožđe puca."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The ore comes through the passes: hold a pass or a fort on a horde's road, so the smiths know the road can be kept."
msgstr "Ruda dolazi kroz klance: zadrži klanac ili utvrdu na putu horde, da kovači znaju da se put može održati."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Iron forged under Svarog's eye carries the road over the fire. The forge must burn without break, fed by ore brought in through the passes."
msgstr "Gvožđe kovano pod Svarogovim okom nosi put preko vatre. Kovačnica mora goreti bez prekida, hranjena rudom dovezenom kroz klance."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Guardian Rails"
msgstr "Ograda čuvara"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The guardians' faces are copied from the old idols: bring back their likeness from an ancient site."
msgstr "Lica čuvara preslikana su sa starih idola: donesi njihov lik sa drevnog mesta."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A rail is quenched in the blood of a beast of the North: clear a lair to give the carvers what they need."
msgstr "Ograda se kali u krvi zveri sa Severa: očisti jazbinu da rezbari dobiju ono što im treba."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The rails are carved with the faces of guardians so that nothing from Nav can climb onto the bridge, and every rail must be quenched before it will hold."
msgstr "Na ogradi su urezana lica čuvara da se ništa iz Navi ne bi popelo na most, i svaki deo ograde mora se okaliti pre nego što izdrži."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Ritual Arch"
msgstr "Obredni luk"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember: the volkhvs bind the arch with it, and without it the bridge is only a road for the enemy."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara: volhvi njome vezuju luk, a bez nje most je samo put za neprijatelja."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The arch at the far end closes the crossing. It is bound with a torc of Svarog's fire, and once it stands, everything beyond the river will come at once: Ritual Night."
msgstr "Luk na drugom kraju zatvara prelaz. Vezuje se grivnom od Svarogove vatre, i čim bude stajao, sve s one strane reke doći će odjednom: Obredna noć."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Bring back a relic"
msgstr "Donesi relikviju"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Explore an ancient site while this stage is open."
msgstr "Istraži drevno mesto dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Clear a monster lair"
msgstr "Očisti jazbinu čudovišta"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "An army clears a lair of the North while this stage is open."
msgstr "Vojska očisti jazbinu Severa dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Weather a wave unscathed"
msgstr "Preživi talas bez gubitka"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "A wave ends without the Holy City losing Sanctity since this stage began."
msgstr "Talas se završi a da Sveti grad ne izgubi svetost od početka ove faze."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Hold a strong point"
msgstr "Zadrži uporište"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Win a field battle at a choke point or from a fort while this stage is open."
msgstr "Dobij bitku u polju na tesnacu ili iz utvrde dok je ova faza otvorena."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Craft the ritual torc"
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "Forge the ritual torc from a Svarog's Ember."
msgstr "Iskuj obrednu grivnu od Svarogovog žara."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "With the arch sealed, the volkhvs begin the rite that will close the crossing for good. Every horde in Nav feels it. Tonight they all come at once, from every front, to break the city before the last words are spoken."
msgstr "Kad je luk zapečaćen, volhvi počinju obred koji će zauvek zatvoriti prelaz. Svaka horda u Navi to oseća. Večeras sve dolaze odjednom, sa svih strana, da slome grad pre nego što se izgovore poslednje reči."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Kalinov Bridge holds"
msgstr "Kalinov most stoji"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The last horde broke against the walls and the rite was finished. The bridge over the Smorodina is sealed, Nav is shut, and the bells of the Holy City ring for the first time in a generation. The old faith lives on, because you held."
msgstr "Poslednja horda se razbila o zidine i obred je završen. Most preko Smorodine je zapečaćen, Nav je zatvorena, a zvona Svetog grada zvone prvi put posle jednog pokolenja. Stara vera živi, jer ste vi izdržali."

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The Holy City has fallen"
msgstr "Sveti grad je pao"

#: data/bridge.json
msgid "The walls are breached and the sanctuary fires are out. The hordes pour across the Smorodina unopposed. Some of the people escaped into the forests, carrying the songs with them; perhaps one day they will try again."
msgstr "Zidine su probijene, a vatre u svetilištu ugašene. Horde prelaze Smorodinu bez otpora. Deo naroda pobegao je u šume, noseći pesme sa sobom; možda će jednog dana pokušati ponovo."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Elder's Hall"
msgstr "Starešinska kuća"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The heart of the village. Each level opens another building slot and builds a little faster; every few levels add a place in the build queue and another outpost."
msgstr "Srce sela. Svaki nivo otvara još jedno mesto za gradnju i gradi malo brže; svakih nekoliko nivoa dodaje mesto u redu gradnje i još jednu ispostavu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Woodcutter"
msgstr "Drvoseča"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Cuts wood in the forest around the village."
msgstr "Seče drvo u šumi oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Quarry"
msgstr "Kamenolom"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Breaks stone from the hills around the village."
msgstr "Lomi kamen u brdima oko sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Farm"
msgstr "Njiva"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Grows grain, which feeds the village and its troops."
msgstr "Gaji žito, koje hrani selo i njegove trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Iron Mine"
msgstr "Rudnik gvožđa"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Digs iron for weapons, armour and walls."
msgstr "Kopa gvožđe za oružje, oklope i zidine."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Storehouse"
msgstr "Skladište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "How much of each resource the village can keep; what comes in above it is lost."
msgstr "Koliko svakog resursa selo može da čuva; ono što pređe to se gubi."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Barracks"
msgstr "Kasarna"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains soldiers. Each level trains them faster, and higher levels open stronger troops."
msgstr "Obučava vojnike. Svaki nivo ih obučava brže, a viši nivoi otvaraju jače trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Scout Lodge"
msgstr "Izviđačnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains scouts, who ride out to see a horde before it arrives."
msgstr "Obučava izviđače, koji jašu da vide hordu pre nego što stigne."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Caravan Yard"
msgstr "Karavansko dvorište"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Keeps caravans to carry resources to allies and to the Holy City vault; each level adds more."
msgstr "Drži karavane koji nose resurse saveznicima i u riznicu Svetog grada; svaki nivo dodaje još."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Settlers' Lodge"
msgstr "Dom doseljenika"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Trains settlers, who walk out to found new villages."
msgstr "Obučava naseljenike, koji idu da osnuju nova sela."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Studies the techs of the research tree; what you learn helps all your villages."
msgstr "Proučava znanja iz stabla istraživanja; ono što naučiš pomaže svim tvojim selima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A camp on a nearby hex that gathers what the land gives: wood in forests, stone and iron in hills and mountains, grain on plains and lakes."
msgstr "Logor na obližnjem polju koji skuplja ono što zemlja daje: drvo u šumama, kamen i gvožđe u brdima i planinama, žito na ravnicama i jezerima."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Granary-Temple"
msgstr "Žitnica-hram"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The stag-folk's own: a temple granary that brings in grain and feeds the troops for less."
msgstr "Samo jelenov rod: hramska žitnica koja donosi žito i jeftinije hrani trupe."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Stone Redoubt"
msgstr "Kameno utvrđenje"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The bear-folk's own: a stone keep that makes the garrison harder to break."
msgstr "Samo medvedov rod: kamena kula zbog koje je posadu teže slomiti."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Longhouse Hall"
msgstr "Dugačka dvorana"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The wolf-folk's own: a longhouse where warriors eat less and train faster."
msgstr "Samo vučji rod: duga kuća u kojoj ratnici jedu manje i brže se obučavaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Walls"
msgstr "Bedemi"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "The walls round the village: hordes must break or climb them before they reach the garrison. Higher levels change wood for stone."
msgstr "Zidine oko sela: horde moraju da ih probiju ili preskoče pre nego što dođu do posade. Viši nivoi menjaju drvo kamenom."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Archer Tower"
msgstr "Strelačka kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A tower on the walls: its archers make the garrison strike harder while the walls stand."
msgstr "Kula na zidinama: njeni strelci čine da posada jače udara dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Gate Tower"
msgstr "Kapija-kula"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Strengthens the gate, so the walls take longer to batter down."
msgstr "Ojačava kapiju, pa se zidine duže probijaju."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Ballista Platform"
msgstr "Postolje za balistu"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A great crossbow on the walls that smashes the horde's siege engines."
msgstr "Veliki samostrel na zidinama koji razbija opsadne sprave horde."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Murder Holes"
msgstr "Puškarnice"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Openings over the gate to rain stones on the attackers: the garrison defends better while the walls stand."
msgstr "Otvori iznad kapije za bacanje kamenja na napadače: posada se bolje brani dok zidine stoje."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Moat"
msgstr "Opkop"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "A moat before the walls: it keeps off battering and climbers and slows the building of siege engines; at higher levels it holds water."
msgstr "Jarak pred zidinama: odbija udarce i penjače i usporava gradnju opsadnih sprava; na višim nivoima drži vodu."

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Watchtower"
msgstr "Osmatračnica"

#: data/buildings.json
msgid "Sees hordes coming from farther away, so the warning comes sooner."
msgstr "Vidi horde izdaleka, pa upozorenje stiže ranije."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Jelena"
msgstr "Rod Jelena"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Stag"
msgstr "Jelen"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The stag-folk of the river meadows: first to sow, first to harvest, their villages grow like spring grass. They were never riders."
msgstr "Jelenov rod sa rečnih livada: prvi seju, prvi žanju, a sela im rastu kao prolećna trava. Konjanici nikad nisu bili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Nizhny Novgorod (1781): a red stag walking, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Nižnjeg Novgoroda (1781): crveni jelen u hodu, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Grain and fast village growth"
msgstr "Žito i brz rast sela"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weak cavalry"
msgstr "Slaba konjica"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Rysa"
msgstr "Rod Risa"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Lynx"
msgstr "Ris"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The lynx-folk of the deep woods strike from the shadows of the trees and are gone before the horde can turn. Their elders trust old ways over new learning."
msgstr "Risov rod iz dubokih šuma udara iz senke drveća i nestaje pre nego što se horda okrene. Njihove starešine više veruju starim običajima nego novom znanju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Gomel (granted in 1781): a gold lynx lying, on blue."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Gomelja (dodeljen 1781): zlatni ris koji leži, na plavom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Wood and ambushes"
msgstr "Drvo i zasede"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower research"
msgstr "Sporije istraživanje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Medvěda"
msgstr "Rod Medveda"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Bear"
msgstr "Medved"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The bear-folk of the iron hills dig deep and build thick walls. They are slow to leave the den they have made."
msgstr "Medvedov rod sa gvozdenih brda kopa duboko i zida debele zidove. Teško napuštaju brlog koji su sagradili."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Yaroslavl (1672): a black bear upright with a gold poleaxe, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Jaroslavlja (1672): crni medved uspravljen sa zlatnom sekirom, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Iron and fortifications"
msgstr "Gvožđe i utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Slower expansion"
msgstr "Sporije širenje"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Bobra"
msgstr "Rod Dabra"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Beaver"
msgstr "Dabar"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The beaver-folk know every river and ford; their barges carry what the roads cannot. Their homes are built for trade, not for siege."
msgstr "Dabrov rod zna svaku reku i svaki gaz; njihove barke nose ono što putevi ne mogu. Domovi su im građeni za trgovinu, ne za opsadu."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Bobrov (1781): a beaver in its own colour, on silver."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Bobrova (1781): dabar u svojoj boji, na srebrnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Caravan speed and capacity"
msgstr "Brzina i kapacitet karavana"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Weaker fortifications"
msgstr "Slabija utvrđenja"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Rod Sokola"
msgstr "Rod Sokola"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Falcon"
msgstr "Sokol"

#: data/clans.json
msgid "The falcon-folk of the open steppe ride fast and see far; their scouts come home when others do not. They have little patience for stonework."
msgstr "Sokolov rod sa otvorene stepe jaše brzo i vidi daleko; njihovi izviđači se vraćaju kad drugi ne mogu. Nemaju strpljenja za kamen."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Its arms are those of Sokołów Podlaski (seal of 1764): a falcon on an oak branch with a gold ring in its beak, on gold."
msgstr "Grb mu je grb Sokolova Podlaskog (pečat iz 1764): soko na hrastovoj grani sa zlatnim prstenom u kljunu, na zlatnom polju."

#: data/clans.json
msgid "Cavalry and scouts (fewer scout losses)"
msgstr "Konjica i izviđači (manji gubici izviđača)"

